                                "sense_id": "17e944d4-140c-33a4-9186-9962b555ad8a",
                                "text": "[…] and that by the possession of a central cell in some of the species there is indicated a mergence from Fasciculophyllum into the genus Centrocellulosum--a relationship which it is now my province to trace."
                            },
                            {
