                                "sense_id": "17e944d4-140c-33a4-9186-9962b555ad8a",
                                "text": "In fact, in Lawrence's prose, we see clearly that there is not a mergence of two into one, but on the contrary, an existential distance that allows us to awaken both to the wonders of being alive and to our interconnectedness to the whole of Nature."
